{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1379-demonic-form-ideas","id":1379,"title":"Demonic Form ideas","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-02T16:41:41-07:00","id":1379,"title":"Demonic Form ideas","content":"I'm curious if anyone out there has any idea what their demonic form is going to look like? For me I have several, but I settled on one in particular. My first demon is going to look like a Hunter Spider from WtA.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/430-moonshadow","name":"Moonshadow","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar430_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-02T17:50:15-07:00","id":1409,"title":"","content":"An immobile floating computer; something like an upside down Crey-2 but larger. All chrome and icy blue lights. It's built on two rings, the other ring is bulkier, the inner ring in taller.<br /> <br /> Powers would be: intelligence, networking/machine control, lots and lots of armour, telekinesis - manifesting as the ability to open previously-nonexistant hatches on any surface and pop out remote controlled arms.<br /> <br /> <br /> Basically, turn into a much less human GLaDOS hanging from the ceiling, turn everything around you into Apature; the land is under your control.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>\u201cThere are no rules. Only Principles and natural laws.\u201d - Promethius<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/17686-the-kings-raven-s-homebrwe-index\" target=\"_blank\">My Homebrew no longer fits in a signature, you can find an index of it here</a>.<br /> <b>Full length fan-books I contributed too: </b><a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/princessthehopeful/files/PrincessTheHopeful.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Princess: the Hopeful</a>, <a href=\"https://drive.google.com/drive/folders/0B9DMG5y7ZdngekVaMGNQbTF4RzA\" target=\"_blank\">Leviathan: the Tempest</a>, <a href=\"https://sites.google.com/site/thekingsraven/files/DreamCatchers.pdf?attredirects=0&amp;d=1\" target=\"_blank\">Dream Catchers</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/134-the-kings-raven","name":"The Kings Raven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar134_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3003"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-02T20:07:52-07:00","id":1468,"title":"","content":"Androgynous looking, featureless humanoid made of liquid metal with a good dozen or so translucent glass-like eyes floating around it in a myriad of different orbits. Area around it always smells like ozone. <br /> <br /> Don't know what the powers would be yet. Probably something involving sight with all the eyes. Seeing in a 360<b>\u00b0 </b>sphere around it, night vision, seeing through things. That might be a little too focused though, but I've got plenty of times.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\">unless anyone has any ideas they want to throw at me</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"right\"><i>!</i></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/245-egg","name":"Egg","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar245_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-02T20:12:39-07:00","id":1472,"title":"","content":"A clockwork angel.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/210-siven","name":"Siven","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar210_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"37"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-02T21:03:00-07:00","id":1491,"title":"","content":"I can't help but see Demonic Form as being switched into with a lengthy transformation sequence, a la magical girl anime.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-02T21:04:41-07:00","id":1494,"title":"","content":"Slightly avian humanoid, garbed in a ratty red robe; head is human-shaped by silhouette but obscured by a spherical nimbus of bruise-colored fire and lightning; feet are clawed with immaculate metal talons and spurs; arms are metal and loosely covered in an arcane-looking pattern of grooves, hands are gauntlet-like and lead into flared protrusions reminiscent of small wings along the ulnar sides of the forearms.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-02T22:32:05-07:00","id":1543,"title":"","content":"Like one of the Ophanim, but wrong; wheels within wheels that spin uncontrollably and send off sparks, surrounded by unnatural light and many crying eyes. Anyone who sees it fly or hover is likely to find it oddly sickening.<br /> <br /> That's the basic idea, at least.<br /> <br /> Alternatively? Missingno.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Raksi plays Peek-a-boo for keeps. ~ nalak42","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/203-kleptomania","name":"Kleptomania","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar203_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"557"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T01:33:07-08:00","id":1612,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1379-demonic-form-ideas?p=1491#post1491\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can't help but see Demonic Form as being switched into with a lengthy transformation sequence, a la magical girl anime.</div> </div> </div> </div>Thanks for ruining the game for me before it's even out... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> All jokes aside:<br /> I imagine a Demon with black fibre-bundle muscles visible through a layer of sheet-thin synthetic skin, jolting with electric currents. He's prone to twitching violently as the current runs through him.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":492,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/492-rerave","user":"ReRave","date":". 11-03-2013, 04:39 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/492-rerave","name":"ReRave","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar492_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T02:57:08-08:00","id":1640,"title":"","content":"An androgynous figure with no face, clad in spun golden light. Six wings spring from the figure's back; it holds a harp in two of its hands, and a pair of swords in the others.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T06:44:58-08:00","id":1709,"title":"","content":"A humanoid figure wearing the skull of an unknown creature that conceals most of its face, with fractal horns and wires coming out from the back. Plates of bone and metal on parts of its body. Long torn wires coming out of the back. Blades for feet. Probably wearing a snazzy though simple suit or robe, too.<br /> <br /> Another one: a vaguely humanoid, androgynous creatures, all made of sleek black metal and leather. Its shoulders end in stumps, but many tentacle-like arms come out of its head, individually weak, but able to fuse with each other to improve strength. Large eyes, all concentric red and white circles, are the only features on its head and part of its body. Looks flat, too, like it's always facing you, and the arms operate in the same vertical plane.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Part-time table flipper.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/519-chairkicker","name":"ChairKicker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar519_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T07:26:30-08:00","id":1747,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1379-demonic-form-ideas?p=1491#post1491\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I can't help but see Demonic Form as being switched into with a lengthy transformation sequence, a la magical girl anime.</div> </div> </div> </div>Naw, man, Devil Trigger.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T12:42:56-08:00","id":1978,"title":"","content":"A great dark metal inhuman skull, with the back of the skull grown bulbous and with the mouth coming unhinged showing rows of needle teeth. the skull is burning black and red from an inner furnace. with whipping metal tendrils reaching out from the base of the skull.<br /> <br /> form aspects: cavernous maw, tether, extra mechanical limb, inhuman reflexes, inhuman intelligence, rain of fire, and barbed tail.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/252-basketcase","name":"basketcase","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar252_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T18:13:40-08:00","id":2248,"title":"","content":"Well there are a few demon forms I'd like to try out in the new game:<br /> <br /> -An amorphous flying shadow form of lethal intent. Possible advantages: Flying, intangibility, body weapons, stealth<br /> <br /> -A form that WW might not smile on, a protean form that changes from moment to moment. Possible advantages: all of them,not at the same time, and maybe not even at my control, perhaps they manifest randomly.<br /> <br /> -The form I really want to play with, a fourth dimensional man, an image of man in four dimensions squeezing into 3 dimensional space like a hypercube, appearing to witnesses like an angel if Lovecraft wrote the old testament. Possible advantages: flight, teleportation, superspeed, things like that","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/391-stsword","name":"StSword","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar391_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1635"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T18:33:48-08:00","id":2272,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Satchel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/1379-demonic-form-ideas?p=1747#post1747\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Naw, man, Devil Trigger.</div> </div> </div> </div> <div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"http://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ABX5TwQFPfk\" data-code=\"ABX5TwQFPfk\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/ABX5TwQFPfk/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div><br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Big Grin\" smilieid=\"3\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> For me, I think I want to go beautiful and terrible as the Morning and the Night. A dark, avenging angel who will move Heaven and Hell itself to protect those under her care. I'm thinking most likely something inspired by Jason Chan's Avacyn art, actually: pale but clad in black, eyes ablaze with searing light, razor-edged wings of polished metal reflecting the night sky.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Freelancer </b>\u2022 Available for work!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/109-claire-redfield","name":"Claire Redfield","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar109_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"672"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-03T19:04:05-08:00","id":2290,"title":"","content":"An angel with butterfly wings etched with electronics, with all the features being the various weapons and tools in his robe.<br /> <br /> This is the demon who fell because he found Christianity (he's a Lutheran minister), and thus he's more like an actual angel than the angels. Irony is such a wonderful word.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-04T05:16:24-08:00","id":2532,"title":"","content":"A seamless fusion of metal, flesh and glass. Sometimes humanoid, often something entirely unthinkable.<br /> I find the drawing from some Magic: the Gathering cards very inspiring, especially those from the Phyrexians.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/639-fat2mad","name":"Fat2Mad","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-04T09:22:05-08:00","id":2676,"title":"","content":"Have been trying to come up with a techno Devilman inspired design for this (the more modern design one, not the green skinned Speedo wearing design from the 70s). Strangely had trouble figuring techno details to give it that god machine touch without getting messing with the design too much.<br /> Might set that one aside since its doesn't really go with my cover idea i want to use first.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/637-violinjosh","name":"violinjosh","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar637_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-04T10:13:07-08:00","id":2730,"title":"","content":"I've given it some thought but I don't think I'll be able to be a player in a Demon Game <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> . <br /> <br /> But if I were I would create something truly abstract. Something MC Escher. It would be genderless in form and be very large and circuler. Imagine the outer caseing being something like the circle base thing that Mr. Manhatten made on mars... only with spikes. Inside the rottating rings would be a pulsating blackened smoke thing with one glowing circuitry laden eye seeming to be embedded into a circuit board.<br /> <br /> Something like that. It would follow all of the rules of how things should move as per the book so it shouldn't violate anything but that is what I want.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-10T19:58:50-08:00","id":7835,"title":"","content":"Alphonse's Demonic Form is an androgynous figure that appears to be made of pale, marble-colored flesh that fades to inky black at the fingertips. Its face lacks any features other than seven painted-on eyes. A single wing painfully juts from the flesh of its back on the left side, and resembles nothing so much as a twisted metal antenna, kind of like those found atop old TV sets. It wears an emerald toga and gently hovers a few inches off the ground. (Psychopomp/Saboteur)<br /> <br /> Red's Demonic Form appears as a short, curvaceous female human, with curly, crimson hair that cascades down to her hips. She has no mouth, and her bright eyes (sometimes blue, sometimes green) perpetually glitter with tears. She has four arms that promise a warm, motherly embrace, and a pair of gold-feathered angelic wings.A sword rests on her hip in a scabbard. She is naked. A small, silver halo floats just above her head. (Guardian/Inquisitor)<br /> <br /> Nero's Demonic Form is truly monstrous, a hunched thing seemingly cast from matte black plastic that is cracked from internal heat that shines forth, much like cooling magma. There are no eyes on his vaguely canine head, and a long tongue lashes about past his layered pairs of sharp teeth. His long arms (somewhat simian) end in meaty fists that scrape the floor when he walks. A pair of boiling vents let out a bubbling stream of whatever stuff he's made off down his back. (Destroyer/Tempter)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-14T21:56:22-08:00","id":11062,"title":"","content":"Here's one I've been thinking about, but I'll admit it doesn't have a character to go with it.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b><span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Trebuchet MS\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">Demonic Ophanim</span></span></span></span></b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><i><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">The Wheels are well known to have the most unusual demonic forms amongst the Unchained, and those frequently identified with the Ophanim exemplify this. These strange beings take the form of four thick metallic wheels which whirl about the central body like a gyroscope, covered in eyes with pupils filled with static that wheep an oily substance that evaporates before it touches the ground. At the center of these rings sits a sphere covered in circuitry which makes the rough shape of a single watching eye. Electricity coruscates between the rings and the central sphere. Its central eye blinks with a hiss of steam released by the pressure of an eyelid made of wires, these strange beings are hot to the touch. From nodules on its center mass, floating metal manipulators emerge, allowing the demon fine manipulation even in this terrifying and inhuman form.</span></span></span></i></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><i><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Typically the form of a Psychopomp, the Ophanim serve the God-Machine by overseeing and organizing infrastructure and human cults through their incredible intellect and their ability to see their servants and acquaintances no matter where they are. Their large and imposing presence ensures obedience in their servants and their bodies are very durable, to protect these essential planners. Demons with this form frequently use it to spy on friends and enemies, protecting themselves from would-be attackers through nearly divine terror and an impenetrable hide.</span></span></span></i></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><i><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Modifications:</span></span></b></span></i></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><i><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> Armored Plates, Large Size, Inhuman Intelligence</span></span></span></i></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><i><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Technologies:</span></span></b></span></i></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><i><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> Glory and Terror, Clairvoyant Sight</span></span></span></i></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><i><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Propulsions:</span></span></b></span></i></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><i><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> Flight</span></span></span></i></span><br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><i><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><b><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\">Processes:</span></span></b></span></i></span><span style=\"color:#000000\"><i><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><span style=\"font-family:inherit\"><span style=\"font-size:15px\"> Extra Mechanical Limbs<br /> </span></span></span></i></span> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}